# the startup splash left alone (TUI-DESIGN-2 §5.2 / §5.4): no key — the wordmark ticks at 50 ms (≤ 15 frames in 700 ms)
# and settles by itself into the brand row `─── ◆ jevcode <version> ───`; no wordmark frame at or after the brand row's
# frame; zero clears. The `◆ jevcode` accent span is expected as raw bytes (the brand glyph opens its own colour span).
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect step 0/
expect ◆ jevcode
mark settled
expect sess \$
send /exit
sleep 0.2
send \r
eof
